WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,400
No one can stop me from killing you today

2
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,340
If you are so powerful, then I will admit defeat.

3
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,820
Give you one hour to retreat

4
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:19,780
Otherwise, I will kill this sword master’s son

5
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:24,830
Piece by piece, continue Jiandao to his father. What are you doing?

6
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:29,000
Please come back and be a guest, little daddy

7
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,400
Follow me back to Longmucheng

8
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,960
Wait until your father comes to pick you up. Don’t refuse.

9
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:35,000
Otherwise I will really beat you to death

10
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:41,210
Stop moving, this incompetent bodyguard.

11
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:43,250
I know you can kill me but I promise

12
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,650
I will definitely take this young man on the road before I die

13
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:46,850
I'm going to die

14
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:48,930
If you die, you will die. I can afford the bet.
